{"title":"Help:Redirect","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Redirects</b> are pages that are directed to another page because they have a similar name.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creating_redirects\">Creating redirects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Redirect&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Creating redirects\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simply add <tt>#REDIRECT [[<i>page</i>]]</tt> to the page, replacing <i>page</i> with the name of a page, to redirect it to that page.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"When_to_create_a_redirect\">When to create a redirect</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Redirect&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: When to create a redirect\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Redirects can be created for a page whose title is an alternative name, spelling, or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Naming_conventions#Capitalization\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Naming conventions\">capitalization</a> but reasonable capitalization. Redirects generally should not be inside the <tt>AoPS Wiki</tt>, <tt>Help</tt>, <tt>Category</tt>, or <tt>Template</tt> namespaces, with some exceptions. (This does not mean pages should not be redirected to pages inside these namespaces.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Redirect&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Help:Shortcut\" title=\"Help:Shortcut\">Help:Shortcut</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a tutorial about the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> Forum.</i>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018104945\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 114/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 12/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.838      1 Template:Tutorial\n100.00%    8.838      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31292:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018104945 and revision id 245464. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}